      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im having a really bad UTI and its kind of stinging when i go to the bathroom. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) left over from a previous prescription in my cabinet, can i just take a couple of those to clear it up? i have stage 3 kidney disease so im a bit worried about taking stuff but i really need relief.",
